  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CRPC Cadastral database</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CRPC Fastighetsregister</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet best&#xe5;r i att utv&#xe4;rdera och bed&#xf6;ma statusen p&#xe5; 22 fastighetsregister f&#xf6;r att kunna avg&#xf6;ra hur dessa b&#xe4;st konverteras ochd&#xe4;refter konvertera dessa till CD-ROM f&#xf6;r att kunna anv&#xe4;ndas av &quot;Commission for Real Property Claims of Displaced Persons and Refugees(CRPC)&quot; och lantm&#xe4;terimyndigheten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To evaluate and estimate the status of 22 cadastral registers to find out the best way of converting theese into CD-ROM to make them useful to the &quot;Commission for Real Property Claims of Displaced Persons and Refugees&quot; and to the office of the national land survey.</narrative>
  </description>
